+A visit's scientific fields include observation date, observer list, species cover estimates, and notes. Some edits are unrelated (such as correcting an observer name and adding a missing species), while others are scientifically coupled (such as revising a species identification alongside its cover estimate). The server cannot infer all such relationships from field names, so concurrent edits are preserved intact as whole-visit revisions and resolved by a coordinator rather than merged automatically.
