+#### Unresolved-Work & Resolution Operations (`listPendingReviews`, `resolveVisitReview`)
 
-## Open Design Choice: Concurrent Visit Edits
+- `listPendingReviews`: Returns all visits in `needs_review` status with their `current_revision`, `competing_revisions`, and common base revision context for coordinator comparison.
+- `resolveVisitReview`: Authenticated coordinator operation accepting `{ visit_id, contributing_submission_ids, selected_revision_id | resolved_payload }`. When `resolved_payload` is supplied, the server stores a new immutable revision authored by the coordinator. Records `coordinator_id`, `resolved_at`, `contributing_submission_ids`, and `resulting_revision_id`; updates `current_revision_id`; clears the listed competing revisions; and transitions `visit_status` to `current`.
 
